Each row was judged on the color print and the line print in out/storytime-review/batch-52/pages/.

l2-w06-cover-i-can-see: rating 8.5, clean.
One gray cat sits whole on the fence rail and one white duck swims on the pond. Mia holds one flat hand
over her eyes. The cat is small at book size. Note. Mia has a nose curve and a smile.
The sun ray strokes sit 16 pixels from the disc. Note.

l2-w06-story-page-i-can-see-a-cat: rating 8.5, clean.
Exactly one cat on the fence rail in both prints, with two pointed ears, whiskers, a nose and a mouth.
Mia points at the cat with one index finger. The sun ray strokes sit 23 pixels from the disc. Note.

l2-w06-story-page-i-can-see-a-dog: rating 8.5, clean.
Exactly one puppy runs in the air in both prints. The black patches of the puppy are solid black fills,
as in the color. Note. The sun ray bases sit on the disc on this page.

l2-w06-story-page-i-can-see-a-horse: rating 8.0, clean.
Exactly one white horse behind the fence in both prints. Only the golden brown tail tip of Pip shows, as
one closed fluffy shape that runs to the bottom frame edge. Note. The eyes of Mia are solid black circles
with no eye outline. Note. The sun ray strokes sit 20 pixels from the disc. Note.

l2-w06-story-page-i-can-see-a-duck: rating 8.5, clean.
Exactly one white duck swims on the pond in both prints. Mia waves with an open hand of five fingers.
Two buttons on the straps of the overalls. The sun ray strokes sit 25 pixels from the disc. Note.

l2-w06-story-page-i-can-see-a-fish: rating 8.5, clean.
Exactly one orange fish swims in the pond in both prints, with one eye, a tail and two fins.
Mia kneels and points at the fish. The sun ray strokes sit 28 pixels from the disc. Note.

l2-w06-story-page-i-can-see-a-bird: rating 8.5, clean.
Exactly one blue bird sits on a branch in both prints. Mia points up with one index finger and faces the
camera, so she does not look up. Note. The sun ray strokes sit 20 pixels from the disc. Note.

l2-w06-story-page-i-can-see-a-frog: rating 8.5, clean.
Exactly one green frog sits on a lily pad in both prints, with two big eyes on top.
Mia kneels and points at the frog. The sun ray strokes sit 20 pixels from the disc. Note.

l2-w06-story-page-i-can-see-pip: rating 8.5, clean.
Exactly one Pip jumps at the right in both prints. He has floppy ears only, a collar with one round tag
and one fluffy tail. Mia opens both arms. The sun ray strokes sit 8 pixels from the disc. Note.

